  "prefLabel": "App 101.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "App 101.02 Applicability. These rules shall apply to any person, firm, corporation, trade association, or craft group only after such person, firm, corporation, trade association, or craft group has voluntarily elected to enter into the provisions within, through registration of an apprenticeship program with the New Hampshire state apprenticeship council.\n\nSource. #6364-A, eff 10-29-96",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/app100-500.html"
}
